  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4f0e614db1e0d4010b97ca7da740d6f6, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialoguePrisoner
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: PRISONER
    text: "HEY YOU, YES, I\u2019M TALKING TO YOU.\nI\u2019M SORRY ABOUT WHAT HAPPENED
      TO YOUR FRIEND, BUT THE CAPTAIN HAS ALWAYS BEEN HOT-TEMPERED.\nYES, HE\u2019S
      THE CAPTAIN \u2014 AND UNLIKE US, HE\u2019S GOT A WONDERFUL ROOM ALL TO HIMSELF
      UP ON DECK."
  - speakerName: PRSONER
    text: "HE WASN\u2019T TOO KIND TO ME EITHER, YOU SEE \u2014 HE LEFT ME HERE TO
      ROT.\nI GUESS I\u2019M NOT THE ONLY ONE WHO\u2019D LIKE TO TEACH HIM A LESSON,
      RIGHT?\nIT WON\u2019T BE EASY THOUGH. EVERYONE ON THIS FLOATING WRECK HAS SWORN
      LOYALTY TO HIM."
  - speakerName: PRISONER
    text: "OH, AND BY THE WAY... IF THEY HAVEN\u2019T CHANGED THE PATROLS, A GUARD
      SHOULD BE PASSING BY IN A FEW SECONDS.\nAT LEAST YOU CAN TAKE IT OUT ON HIM.
      BUT I SUGGEST YOU HIDE BEHIND THAT BARREL RIGHT AFTER, UNLESS YOU WANT TO GET
      HURT."
  - speakerName: PRSONER
    text: "IF I WERE YOU, I\u2019D TRY TO FOCUS INTENSELY ON THAT BRUTE YOU BIT EARLIER
      IF YOU TRUST A POOR PRISONER, THAT IS"
  - speakerName: PRISONER
    text: "IF I WERE YOU, I\u2019D TRY TO FOCUS INTENSELY ON THAT BRUTE YOU BIT EARLIER
      \u2014 IF YOU TRUST A POOR PRISONER, THAT IS"
  - speakerName: PRISONERS
    text: WELL DONE, LITTLE ONE. THANKS FOR HELPING ME WITH THAT HENCHMAN. OUR PATHS
      WILL CROSS AGAIN SOON
